These patch notes are from the Official EverQuest Legends discord, posted on May 31, 2026

= May 31, 2026 =

= Hotfix =

* Lay on Hands has been updated to function with implied targeting and related systems.
* Dragoon Zytl will now give experience when killed.
* Fix a crash on zone servers.
* Fix an issue where, as a charmed player, you would be suicided as an NPC clone when the caster of the charm dies.
* Paineel Armor and Weapon merchants should once again sell adventuring gear, instead of spells!
* Reduced difficulty scaling of mob haste.
* Amplification (Bard Song) no longer amplifies itself.
* Amplification has been buffed slightly.
* Fixed an issue where loot lockouts in dynamic zones were not using the proper type of dynamic timer.
* Fix an issue where players would not be counted as actual players for personal loot purposes when charmed, feared or linkdead.